{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块超大白色文字，首先被绿色放大的“舒服地待在亲近里”吸引，随后注意到“暂时哪里也不去”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正处于与另一个人亲近相处的状态，暂时不去考虑两个人的未来，只想停留在当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、自在、放松、安静。\",\n  \"missed\": \"下方关于想表达喜欢、想确认对方心意却没能开口的犹豫；中间小字对水波、声音和思绪的进一步描写。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块字号接近、亮度较高的大字都在争夺主视线。\",\n    \"上方主文字较长，包含不考虑未来、享受亲近、沉默自在、思绪漂远等多个层次。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b3676198-3cae-4e2a-af86-c981307cab98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021006682503Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:10:56.740739+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb71f2230a37973ff8fdfe9a08c09a24c34cfa76482180f4e1a16ec40cff5a13", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1